  "body": "As we discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/sg/issues/215, we're going to move URLPattern into WHATWG.\r\n\r\nHere is the checklist that we should cover.\r\n\r\n- [x] Reach WHATWG SG agreement: https://github.com/whatwg/sg/issues/215\r\n- [x] Transfer repository from WICG to WHATWG\r\n- [x] Create a logo: https://github.com/whatwg/whatwg.org/pull/427 and generally complete the checklist in https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/NEW-STANDARD.md\r\n- [x] Update the document in this repository to account for this move\r\n- [x] Add redirect for github.io URLs ([like this](https://github.com/WICG/wicg.github.io/blob/main/picture-in-picture/index.html)): https://github.com/WICG/wicg.github.io/pull/22\r\n\r\ncc @domenic @jeremyroman ",
